WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
One repo, three worktrees, three branches

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Three agents work at the same time, in separate folders

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Two shared files are about to collide

4
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Fix it before you start: one owner for each shared file

5
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Merge one branch at a time. Settings goes first.

6
00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Rebase export onto the result, run the tests, merge

7
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Email last, then test the merged result

8
00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Remove the worktrees and delete the merged branches
